# Ignore everything by default, then whitelist the project's text and small artifacts.
# Heavy binaries (images, chunks, toolchains, unpacked ramdisks) stay local-only.
*
!*/
!*.md
!*.txt
!*.py
!*.sh
!*.dts
!*.dtsi
!*.dtb
!*.dtbo
!*.c
!*.h
!*.cc
!*.cpp
!*.hpp
!*.rs
!*.json
!*.yaml
!*.yml
!*.toml
!*.conf
!*.cfg
!*.ini
!*.patch
!*.diff
!*.xml
!*.html
!*.css
!*.js
!*.ts
!*.sql
!*.mk
!*.ac
!*.in
!*.am
!*.S
!*.s
!*.pl
!*.awk
!*.sed
!*.bash
!*.rules
!*.rc
!*.prop
!*.service
!*.ld
!*.lds
!Makefile
!Kbuild
!Kconfig*
!README*
!NOTES*
!LICENSE*
!.gitignore
!AGENTS.md
!build-packages
!*ramoops*

# Heavy dirs that stay local-only, even for whitelisted text
work/toolchain/
cleanup-quarantine/
temp/
rollout-*.jsonl
